@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Ticket / Slice Loop — Implement, Verify, Diagnose, Re-plan

state "Select dependency-ready Slice\nRead Plan + Ticket + shared branch evidence" as select
state "Define Slice contract\nGoal / scope / exclusions / dependencies\nAcceptance / test strategy / level / cases / command" as contract
state "Minimal implementation\nTest-first when useful\nBounded delegation optional" as implement
state "Focused verification\nCheapest relevant checks first" as focused
state "Mandatory risk dimensions\nBoundary / negative / integration / regression\nProperty / mutation / E2E / isolation when applicable" as dimensions
state "Test Quality Gate" as gate
state "Classify failure\nImplementation / test / regression / environment\nflaky / requirement conflict" as diagnose
state "Fix in-scope defect" as fix
state "Blocked\nRecord cause + exact resume point" as blocked
state "Re-plan Slice / Ticket\nUpdate boundaries and acceptance" as replan
state "Slice complete\nRecord executed evidence" as slice_done
state "Ticket complete\nAll Slices + acceptance satisfied" as ticket_done

[*] --> select
select --> contract
contract --> implement
implement --> focused
focused --> diagnose : failure
focused --> dimensions : GREEN
dimensions --> diagnose : missing / failed evidence
dimensions --> gate : required dimensions satisfied
gate --> diagnose : BLOCKED
gate --> slice_done : PASS
diagnose --> fix : implementation / test defect
fix --> focused
diagnose --> blocked : external dependency
blocked --> select : cause resolved
diagnose --> replan : requirement / design conflict
implement --> replan : wrong assumption exposed
replan --> select
slice_done --> select : more Slices
slice_done --> ticket_done : all Slices complete
ticket_done --> [*]

note right of gate
A GREEN test level is not enough by itself.
Every acceptance criterion needs executed evidence.
Applicable dimensions must pass or have a concrete N/A reason.
Retry cannot turn unexplained flaky failure into PASS.
end note
@enduml
